.SH "undici-types"
.PP
This package is a dual-publish of the \fRundici\fP library types\&. The \fRundici\fP package \fBstill contains types\fP\&. This package is for users who \fIonly\fP need undici types (such as for \fR@types/node\fP)\&. It is published alongside every release of \fRundici\fP, so you can always use the same version\&.

